# EVM client-proved pool: CreateX CREATE3 salts, PERMISSIONED form (bytes 0..19 = deployer, byte 20 = 0x00).
# CreateX guards them as keccak256(abi.encode(deployer, salt)): only the deployer lands these addresses, and it
# lands the same ones on every chain. Verified by simulating deployCreate3 against mainnet CreateX from the
# deployer (and from another sender, which lands elsewhere). Deploy: contracts/script/DeployEvmPoolCreateX.s.sol
